#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: municipal-phonebook.php includes/class-munipb-elementor-widget.php:37
#: includes/class-munipb-elementor.php:39
msgid "Municipal Phonebook"
msgstr "Τηλεφωνικός Κατάλογος Δήμου"

#. Description of the plugin
#: municipal-phonebook.php
msgid ""
"Searchable telephone directory grouped by departments and sub-departments, "
"with accent-insensitive Greek search, category filter, responsive cards, "
"shortcode, block and Elementor widget."
msgstr ""
"Τηλεφωνικός κατάλογος ανά διεύθυνση και τμήμα, με αναζήτηση χωρίς τόνους, "
"φίλτρο κατηγοριών, responsive κάρτες, shortcode, block και widget Elementor."

#. Author of the plugin
#: municipal-phonebook.php
msgid "dev"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-munipb-admin.php:57
msgid "Full name or office name"
msgstr "Ονοματεπώνυμο ή όνομα γραφείου"

#: includes/class-munipb-admin.php:68
msgid "Contact details"
msgstr "Στοιχεία επικοινωνίας"

#: includes/class-munipb-admin.php:86
msgid "Role / title"
msgstr "Ιδιότητα / θέση"

#: includes/class-munipb-admin.php:90
msgid "Phones"
msgstr "Τηλέφωνα"

#: includes/class-munipb-admin.php:93
msgid ""
"One line per group. Separate numbers on the same line with | (e.g. "
"2132018733 | 2132018712)."
msgstr ""
"Μία γραμμή ανά ομάδα. Χωρίστε τα τηλέφωνα της ίδιας γραμμής με | (π.χ. "
"2132018733 | 2132018712)."

